t of you!\nDate in a new dimension with Dating.com, one of the leading global online dating communities.\n Make dating more engaging and exciting!\n\n**Discover deep, immersive VR connections:**\n- A variety of dynamic VR profiles\n- Date anyone, anywhere instantly\n- Fun 1-on-1 VR calls\n- Meaningful connections for real love\n- Safe, easy, convenient (Includes moderation tools to support a respectful environment.)\n\n**REAL SINGLES, 3D WORLD**\n\nMeet new people globally in a realistic virtual space. Connect anywhere, with endless possibilities.\n\n**CONNECT IN VIRTUAL REALITY**\n\nForget the hassles of traditional dating apps. Dating.com VR focuses on what matters \u2013 emotions, feelings, and sensations.\n\n**MATCH PERFECTLY IN VR**\n\nQuickly find standout profiles with our Popular Members feature. Share a 1-on-1 video call face-to-face in the virtual world. Let sparks fly!\n\n**IMPORTANT MONETIZATION DETAILS**\n\n- Use credits to unlock full access to chat and connect via VR.\n- Credits give you the power of interactive communication without limits.\n- Your account will be charged once you confirm your purchase.\n- One-time in-app purchases for credits used to access premium VR chats. No subscription required.\nOur platform includes content moderation tools to ensure a safe experience.", "short_description": "Experience immersive 3D dating in VR with singles from around the world.\nDating.com VR offers 1-on-1 video chats with matches who share your interests.\nExplore a new dimension of dating with VR technology from Dating.com.\nA fun new way to connect!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vr.dating.com/landing/app/terms/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vr.dating.com/landing/app/terms/terms-and-conditions", "publisher_name": "SOL Networks Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.dating.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [],